stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Received
    Received --> Rejected: input guard rejects
    Received --> Queued: accepted
    Queued --> Analysing: enclave claims the job
    Analysing --> NeedsInfo: version or logs missing
    NeedsInfo --> Queued: customer replies
    Analysing --> InReview: low confidence, guard flag, doc gap
    Analysing --> BugCandidate: suspected bug or security issue
    Analysing --> Answered: auto-send (usage, config, known issue)
    InReview --> Answered: operator approves or edits
    BugCandidate --> Confirmed: operator confirms, issue linked
    BugCandidate --> Answered: not a bug
    Confirmed --> Answered: workaround or fix announced
    Answered --> Queued: customer follows up
    Answered --> Closed: solved, or 14 days without reply
    Rejected --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]
